<br>This edition brings together some of the most grounded perspectives on =
building agents, memory and GraphRAG implementations that hold up in the re=
al world.=20
<br>I also wanted to take the opportunity to highlight the Essential GraphR=
AG book that you can get for free. Finally, we take a closer look at the AI=
 memory gap and hear how GraphRAG, neuro-symbolic AI and graph-based memory=
